Current status
What works:

Full end-to-end multimodal pipeline from image upload to live sandboxed render.

Theme preset selection (Modern Clean, Dark Cyberpunk, Minimalist Slate).

Built-in "Load Backup Sample" button to guarantee zero demo failures if venue Wi-Fi drops.

1-click code copying and syntax viewer.

Known limitations / incomplete features:

Optimized for atomic single-page UI components (e.g., forms, cards, dashboards) rather than multi-screen application routing.

Generates structural UI and CSS layout rather than complex state management logic or backend database connections.

What you would improve next:

Add export support for custom design tokens and frameworks (Vue.js, Svelte, and raw React Native).

Support multi-component batch scanning from a single whiteboard photo.

